<title>BELGIUM: EU welcomes Spanish EMU plans.</title>
<headline>EU welcomes Spanish EMU plans.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union finance ministers welcomed on Monday Spain's economic convergence plan showing its progress towards meeting economic and monetary union, a Spanish diplomat said.</p>
<p>He said EU monetary affairs commissioner Yves Thibault de Silguy had described the plan as &quot;well balanced and realistic.&quot;</p>
<p>The plan updates the forecast on budget deficit, debt, inflation and other economic indicators up to 2000.</p>
</text>
